	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nQ53hkeoXU05Faicv",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 14, DX 11, IQ 10, HT 11, HP 14, WILL 10, PER 11, FP 11, SPEED 5.5, MOVE 5, DODGE 8, DR 1. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nmQGAZ1h6V3MBQbq7",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 18 (offense 12, protection 6), threat tier minor, appearing 3."
		},
		{
			"id": "nXLKwl7qrlAU5FfK7",
			"text": "Javelin: Javelin (13): 1d+1 impaling, Reach Ranged, 15. Thrown to open an ambush, from the dark, at the person carrying the light."
		},
		{
			"id": "n3Y6kS6RY5ULJAwVa",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/bugbear.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nIlPDtEXnlXjU4_Gj",
			"text": "Independent build total: 87 points of racial traits plus 22 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nYDeVu1lSM7VZp0CJ",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Bugbear (SRD 5.1); Bugbear (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "na9QCUORgrSwtME0F",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nA9V7N-TaIm77w6aH",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 115 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "n4mK4KJXzFbEYUUSe",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nf9QJV6xB43g1TTkO",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "n49UbBrB2T7IC6TBn",
			"text": "About 2.1 m standing, which reads on the published table as the SM 0 row rather than the +1 row at 2.7 m."
		},
		{
			"id": "nYEzmHjwa4lkZXFFO",
			"text": "ST 14 from Basic Lift: it carries a body over one shoulder without slowing to a walk."
		},
		{
			"id": "nxT3ckBC37bn09yu6",
			"text": "Silence 2 is the whole creature. It is bought as the published advantage rather than left to the Stealth skill, because the skill is what it does with the quiet and the quiet is what it is."
		},
		{
			"id": "nrwSDtmnAGFpy9K4Z",
			"text": "DR 1 is hide, not armour: bugbears mostly wear leather, and that DR is not in this record. See decision 11 in the build policy."
		},
		{
			"id": "noSnCzD-jFWhVMPn9",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
